  "bio": "Aenima Paris is a highly skilled tattoo artist known for their expertise in illustrative and fineline styles. Residing in the historic Le Marais district of Paris, France, Aenima ensures that each piece of art is delivered with the utmost professionalism, whether it's a delicate fineline creation or a more complex illustrative design. Clients can expect a seamless experience that honors both the craft and the comfort of the wearer in Aenima's cruelty-free shop.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Paris, Ile-de-france, France\n\n🏴 𝕻𝖆𝖗𝖎𝖘 🖤 𝘾𝙧𝙪𝙚𝙡𝙩𝙮 𝙛𝙧𝙚𝙚 𝙨𝙝𝙤𝙥 𝙞𝙣 𝙇𝙚 𝙈𝙖𝙧𝙖𝙞𝙨\n⚜ 𝐅𝐢𝐧𝐞 𝐣𝐞𝐰𝐞𝐥𝐫𝐲 / 𝐋𝐮𝐱𝐮𝐫𝐲 𝐩𝐢𝐞𝐫𝐜𝐢𝐧𝐠𝐬 @aenima.piercing\n✊ 𝐀𝐧𝐢𝐦𝐚𝐥 𝐫𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭𝐬",
